            "detailed_description": "Gunslinger Trainer is a western VR game where you have to train to become the ultimate gunslinger of the west. Shoot, Explode and Throw items at a variety of targets in different western locales to become the ultimate be it all Gunslinger.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your resourcefulness by destroying targets in unique ways with items that are scattered around to be used at your disposal. Light up some sticks of dynamite, throw a knife, throw an axe! Anything to score more points!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKick back and relax by practicing your marksman skills by shooting objects on the side, as well as discovering secrets that are hidden in each level.",
